**/*_Runs/
**/.Xil/
*.log
*.logw
*.db
*.timing
*.rpt
*.area
*.ts
*.qor
*.violation
.*.f

# TD 的 IP 参数缓存 / 阶段暂存目录：2026-10-13 已从 soc_base 删除 100 个，
# 实测命令行编译（read_design/opt_rtl/opt_gate）不会重新生成。若某次开 GUI
